## Detect closing window
It comes handy to stop tasks, or free up memory when a user closes a notebook

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Detect closing window
It comes handy to stop tasks, or free up memory when a user closes a notebook

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
test = {0,1,0};

EventHandler[CurrentWindow[], {"Closed" -> Function[Null,
  test = {1,0,0};
]}];

Graphics[{RGBColor[test // Offload], Disk[{0,0}, 1]}]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
*Try to close notebook window and open again*

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
*Try to close notebook window and open again*

